OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks receive Co-op funding
OL,4,Aboost
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 40 foodbanks have received a
OL,7,Fwinter funding boost from Lincolnshire
OL,8,FCo-op.
OL,10,FOver #225,000 has been shared between
OL,11,F42 groups across Lincolnshire, parts of
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, Nottinghamshire and
OL,13,FHull.
OL,15,FAmong the recipients is Lincoln Food
OL,16,Fbank, which is run by the Acts Trust,
OL,17,Fand has received #20,000.
OL,19,FServices manager Carolyn Bradbury said
OL,20,Fthe money would help cove "a lot of our
OL,21,Foverheads that we have desperately
OL,22,Fsought funding for".
